WEBVTT

01:41.550 --> 01:45.950
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.580 --> 01:48.930
[Episode 34]

01:52.150 --> 01:52.710
So,

01:53.479 --> 01:54.479
like this, right now,

01:55.000 --> 01:56.310
Master, don't you like it?

01:57.039 --> 01:58.479
Don't you want moments like this

01:58.759 --> 01:59.509
to last forever?

02:02.310 --> 02:02.920
Master.

02:04.680 --> 02:05.150
Fine.

02:05.680 --> 02:06.760
You're always so talkative.

02:13.910 --> 02:15.360
I actually have grown attached

02:15.680 --> 02:16.710
to this ephemeral joy

02:17.480 --> 02:19.150
and useless happiness.

02:20.960 --> 02:21.710
Over the years,

02:22.910 --> 02:23.870
my state of mind

02:23.870 --> 02:24.910
has actually changed so much.

02:30.520 --> 02:31.000
Guardian,

02:31.630 --> 02:32.710
Yu Chen sent a message.

02:32.800 --> 02:33.710
Ye Xin has returned to the capital.

02:35.710 --> 02:36.270
Stiffly Su,

02:36.520 --> 02:37.210
didn't you say

02:37.240 --> 02:37.960
once I finished crafting the magical weapon

02:37.960 --> 02:39.800
to break the imperial palace's defense formation,

02:39.850 --> 02:40.800
I could come and go freely

02:40.800 --> 02:41.710
here at Mount Wester?

02:45.000 --> 02:45.800
Listen,

02:46.520 --> 02:47.590
if you hadn't secretly

02:47.590 --> 02:48.960
brought Ranran back to Mount Wester again,

02:49.360 --> 02:50.240
I wouldn't even bother with you.

02:53.870 --> 02:54.960
Where's the thing you made?

02:55.750 --> 02:56.470
Where's Ranran?

02:56.960 --> 02:57.800
Did you bully her?

02:59.240 --> 03:00.870
Actually, since coming back this time,

03:01.080 --> 03:02.000
Guardian has been very caring

03:02.030 --> 03:02.870
towards Ranran.

03:03.360 --> 03:04.080
That's more like it.

03:04.630 --> 03:05.310
He should be.

03:06.910 --> 03:07.840
With this thing,

03:08.310 --> 03:09.870
you can come and go freely in the imperial palace.

03:14.510 --> 03:15.190
You brat,

03:15.360 --> 03:16.590
you won't even say thank you now,

03:16.590 --> 03:17.079
huh?

03:17.910 --> 03:19.120
-I can't believe you.
-Mr. Zeng Yi.

03:20.280 --> 03:20.680
Ranran.

03:23.910 --> 03:24.710
Why are you here?

03:25.630 --> 03:26.280
Yu Chen sent a message,

03:26.280 --> 03:27.400
saying Ye Xin has entered the capital.

03:27.810 --> 03:29.090
Guardian borrowed Mr. Zeng's magical weapon

03:29.120 --> 03:29.870
and went to the capital.

03:32.470 --> 03:33.840
If Master confronts him,

03:34.710 --> 03:35.960
who knows what will happen?

03:42.400 --> 03:42.910
Guards!

03:43.520 --> 03:44.470
I want to see my father!

03:44.710 --> 03:45.430
Guards!

03:45.590 --> 03:46.360
Guards!

03:50.850 --> 03:52.370
Prince Kang, Su Yan,

03:53.810 --> 03:55.970
conspired with eunuchs and intended to rebel.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.870
You're disloyal and unfilial!

04:01.190 --> 04:02.680
Father is

04:04.240 --> 04:05.630
extremely disappointed in you.

04:06.360 --> 04:07.360
He doesn't want to see you.

04:08.310 --> 04:09.630
Why would I harm my father?

04:10.960 --> 04:11.840
It was you,

04:13.190 --> 04:14.000
Su Yu.

04:14.190 --> 04:14.960
It was you.

04:15.360 --> 04:16.600
You framed me!

04:16.920 --> 04:17.600
You've already

04:17.630 --> 04:19.070
gained complete control over the court.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.160
You deceived His Majesty.

04:20.180 --> 04:21.980
You're the disloyal and unfilial one!

04:24.430 --> 04:25.360
Stop!

04:26.830 --> 04:28.190
Do you really think that without me,

04:28.920 --> 04:30.360
you can gain complete control?

04:30.920 --> 04:32.159
Do you think Father knows nothing

04:32.190 --> 04:34.070
about the strange occurrences in the capital?

04:34.630 --> 04:35.510
Su Yu!

04:35.800 --> 04:37.360
You can never have peace!

04:37.650 --> 04:38.770
Su Yu!

04:38.570 --> 04:43.620
[Convergence of Auspiciousness]

05:05.750 --> 05:06.270
Who's there?

05:08.270 --> 05:09.000
Your... Your Highness.

05:09.430 --> 05:09.950
It's me.

05:10.870 --> 05:11.660
It's late and cold.

05:12.120 --> 05:13.830
I just wanted to ask you to go back to your room.

05:17.830 --> 05:19.040
So what if it's you?

05:20.760 --> 05:21.800
Those around you are all kinds

05:21.830 --> 05:22.800
of men of sacrifice

05:23.000 --> 05:23.920
and spies.

05:25.120 --> 05:26.270
Who can you trust?

05:27.390 --> 05:28.200
Wu Mi,

05:30.080 --> 05:31.270
how long have you been by my side?

05:32.510 --> 05:33.040
Your Highness,

05:33.740 --> 05:34.330
I became your shadow guard

05:34.360 --> 05:35.430
right after I finished my apprenticeship

05:35.680 --> 05:36.920
in the ninth year of Zhengyong.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.310
It has been ten years.

05:40.360 --> 05:41.270
Ten years?

05:42.310 --> 05:43.600
Nineteen years ago,

05:43.630 --> 05:45.000
Feng came to serve by my side.

05:46.240 --> 05:48.070
I thought he was loyal,

05:48.909 --> 05:50.880
but I never truly knew his background.

05:51.650 --> 05:52.890
Suddenly, he became

05:52.920 --> 05:53.950
someone I didn't know!

05:56.800 --> 05:58.120
So who are you?

05:58.950 --> 06:00.560
What's your purpose of staying by my side?

06:02.040 --> 06:03.240
I swear to God

06:03.950 --> 06:05.390
I'm absolutely loyal to you!

06:15.510 --> 06:16.430
From now on,

06:17.920 --> 06:18.600
without my summoning,

06:19.870 --> 06:20.950
you don't need to appear.

06:25.680 --> 06:26.680
Yes, Your Highness.

06:27.920 --> 06:28.830
Wait.

06:30.960 --> 06:31.720
From now on,

06:34.040 --> 06:35.070
you don't need to be around me

06:35.070 --> 06:36.159
as my shadow guard

06:36.680 --> 06:37.720
at all times.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.390
Go out now

06:42.070 --> 06:44.000
and take an official position as a palace guard.

06:45.750 --> 06:46.310
Your Highness!

06:47.780 --> 06:49.550
I'm concerned about your safety.

06:50.800 --> 06:52.480
Do as I said!

07:00.830 --> 07:01.270
Yes.

07:29.630 --> 07:30.190
Who's there?

07:33.070 --> 07:34.600
So, the capital

07:35.350 --> 07:36.870
traps lonely souls like you.

07:37.480 --> 07:38.630
You taste no flavor in food or drinks

07:38.720 --> 07:39.800
and see enemies everywhere.

07:40.610 --> 07:41.680
Su Yishui,

07:44.180 --> 07:45.500
you actually have the guts to come here.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.680
I go where I please.

07:51.010 --> 07:51.810
I'm looking for Dun Tian.

07:51.950 --> 07:52.560
Where is he?

07:52.950 --> 07:53.950
You came to beg him to undo

07:53.950 --> 07:55.000
the Soul-Cleansing Charm?

07:55.310 --> 07:56.190
Or

07:56.390 --> 07:57.600
you still can't accept

07:57.630 --> 07:58.480
that you've long been

07:58.480 --> 07:59.720
my defeated foe,

07:59.950 --> 08:00.830
you failed to get what you want,

08:00.830 --> 08:02.120
and you're left with nothing,

08:02.720 --> 08:04.120
so you came to make a futile attempt?

08:05.680 --> 08:06.750
You live

08:06.840 --> 08:08.400
in constant fear and paranoia,

08:08.430 --> 08:09.310
and your life is so dull.

08:09.720 --> 08:10.950
There's nothing enviable about that.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.510
The winner takes all, and the loser gets nothing.

08:13.320 --> 08:14.530
I am the winner.

08:15.430 --> 08:16.680
You've never even seen

08:17.920 --> 08:19.600
the scenery here before.

08:21.800 --> 08:23.270
I can come here whenever I want.

08:23.750 --> 08:24.870
Who can stop me?

08:25.120 --> 08:25.830
Su Yishui,

08:26.950 --> 08:27.630
it seems

08:27.650 --> 08:28.920
you've never beaten me so far.

08:29.870 --> 08:31.070
Stop daydreaming.

08:32.270 --> 08:33.000
I'm not interested

08:33.000 --> 08:34.240
in competing with a sickly person.

08:34.789 --> 08:36.000
Look at you now.

08:37.000 --> 08:38.360
I guess you don't have many days left.

08:40.000 --> 08:41.000
With someone like Dun Tian,

08:41.030 --> 08:42.549
a powerful immortal, helping me,

08:43.360 --> 08:44.480
I will naturally still be the one

08:44.510 --> 08:45.600
who takes all in the end.

08:46.200 --> 08:46.790
Is that so?

08:47.790 --> 08:48.550
I heard you wanted

08:48.550 --> 08:50.030
to use my body to extend your life

08:50.390 --> 08:51.360
and marry Xue Ranran.

08:52.150 --> 08:53.270
Unfortunately, all your schemes

08:53.270 --> 08:54.360
amounted to nothing.

08:54.670 --> 08:55.550
So what if you have Dun Tian's help?

08:56.440 --> 08:57.480
He couldn't even save

08:57.480 --> 08:58.360
his own wife or daughters.

08:58.840 --> 09:00.360
You can't attain ascension or understand

09:00.670 --> 09:01.840
the true meaning of immortality,

09:02.440 --> 09:03.150
of course you don't know

09:03.150 --> 09:04.600
how to make everything start anew.

09:05.000 --> 09:05.630
Make everything start anew?

09:07.720 --> 09:08.720
How?

09:11.630 --> 09:12.440
Why bother asking?

09:13.270 --> 09:15.080
You'll enter this game sooner or later.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.080
If you were to die right now,

09:26.690 --> 09:27.930
could you still make everything start anew?

09:39.480 --> 09:40.000
Who's there?

10:07.670 --> 10:08.740
Dun Tian,

10:09.240 --> 10:10.440
you gave up being an immortal.

10:10.440 --> 10:11.270
Fine, that's your choice.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.750
But what grudge do you have against me?

10:12.770 --> 10:13.890
Why did you attack me again and again?

10:28.150 --> 10:29.030
Su Yishui,

10:29.720 --> 10:31.360
I am not your enemy.

10:31.670 --> 10:34.240
Everything I've done is to help you.

10:34.870 --> 10:35.630
Help me?

10:36.680 --> 10:37.640
You are lurking

10:37.670 --> 10:38.870
in Prince Ping's residence and won't show up.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.030
You deliberately made a plan

10:40.050 --> 10:41.410
to get the Spirit Spring into my heart.

10:41.920 --> 10:42.760
And you launched a sneak attack on me,

10:42.790 --> 10:44.200
erased my memories, and disturbed my mind.

10:44.320 --> 10:45.200
Is that how you help me?

10:45.360 --> 10:46.600
I just want you to know

10:46.720 --> 10:48.720
how one wrong step

10:48.750 --> 10:49.720
led to another,

10:49.720 --> 10:51.720
until you lost everything.

10:53.290 --> 10:54.170
Mu Qingge,

10:54.200 --> 10:55.510
I will spend my whole life seeking revenge!

10:55.840 --> 10:57.120
Su Yu, Prince Ping,

10:57.360 --> 10:59.080
and everyone who plotted against me must die!

11:04.030 --> 11:05.030
You're all the same!

11:05.340 --> 11:06.460
You all betrayed me!

11:07.200 --> 11:08.240
Mu Qingge,

11:09.120 --> 11:10.480
I will definitely kill you!

11:13.390 --> 11:15.670
Even if you torture me to death,

11:15.940 --> 11:18.700
when Prince Ping reigns over the universe

11:19.030 --> 11:21.510
and wipes out Prince Zong's men,

11:22.510 --> 11:24.630
you'll get what you deserve.

11:27.630 --> 11:28.360
Xiaoxiao?

11:28.870 --> 11:29.480
Yes.

11:29.630 --> 11:30.320
It's her.

11:30.600 --> 11:31.720
Back then, the Prince Zong's residence

11:31.750 --> 11:33.720
spread news of Su Xiaoxiao's death.

11:33.910 --> 11:36.000
The truth is she wandered from place to place

11:36.000 --> 11:37.240
and suffered all kinds of humiliation.

11:37.840 --> 11:39.440
She was originally unyielding even in the face of death.

11:39.840 --> 11:40.790
Guess why

11:40.790 --> 11:42.670
she later became disheartened

11:42.840 --> 11:44.360
and lived like a walking corpse.

11:45.260 --> 11:46.170
Ever since she knew

11:46.200 --> 11:47.600
you gave up on claiming the throne,

11:47.750 --> 11:49.030
she had been like that.

11:49.790 --> 11:52.320
Poor girl. It was wrong for her to trust you back then.

11:52.550 --> 11:53.630
She and you

11:53.750 --> 11:56.030
shouldn't have ended up like this.

12:08.430 --> 12:09.910
The dragon scale foretells the future.

12:10.190 --> 12:11.360
This was the destiny you were

12:11.390 --> 12:12.910
meant to fulfill 19 years ago —

12:13.240 --> 12:14.360
ruling the universe

12:14.390 --> 12:15.510
with unparalleled power.

12:16.120 --> 12:17.550
If Mu Qingge hadn't intervened

12:17.640 --> 12:19.970
and forcibly changed everything,

12:20.320 --> 12:22.790
you would have already fulfilled your wish.

12:23.320 --> 12:25.320
I've brought you back to the beginning.

12:25.510 --> 12:26.960
This will once again become

12:26.960 --> 12:28.360
your future destiny.

12:28.750 --> 12:30.200
It's fated.

12:30.480 --> 12:32.320
You will be there no matter what.

12:33.120 --> 12:34.150
Then what about you?

12:34.520 --> 12:35.970
What role do you play in all of this?

12:44.840 --> 12:46.790
I'm merely a guide.

12:47.320 --> 12:48.440
If my reigning over the universe

12:48.440 --> 12:49.600
is the final outcome,

12:50.600 --> 12:51.720
why is Su Yu so certain

12:51.740 --> 12:52.910
that he will get the last laugh?

12:53.480 --> 12:54.480
Isn't that contradictory?

12:55.480 --> 12:56.630
It can only prove

12:57.030 --> 12:57.750
both I

12:58.000 --> 12:58.840
and Su Yu

12:59.240 --> 13:00.360
are merely pawns for you to fulfill

13:00.360 --> 13:01.200
your wish.

13:03.320 --> 13:04.790
And everything you've done

13:05.500 --> 13:06.690
is just to bring your wife and daughters

13:06.720 --> 13:07.790
back to your side.

13:11.720 --> 13:12.670
Clever.

13:13.240 --> 13:14.120
It seems

13:14.910 --> 13:15.840
you've guessed

13:15.870 --> 13:16.870
part of the answer.

13:18.080 --> 13:18.910
However,

13:19.550 --> 13:21.510
while fulfilling my wish,

13:22.510 --> 13:23.270
we can also fulfill

13:23.320 --> 13:24.630
the wishes of many others.

13:25.360 --> 13:26.360
We can achieve

13:26.910 --> 13:28.030
a win-win situation.

13:30.360 --> 13:31.390
I'm all ears.

13:32.200 --> 13:32.910
Don't be impatient.

13:33.390 --> 13:34.360
It's not the time yet.

13:36.260 --> 13:37.210
You're being cagey.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.320
So much for the win-win situation.

13:38.960 --> 13:40.150
Do you expect me to be like Su Yu,

13:40.410 --> 13:41.600
relying on you to live

13:41.630 --> 13:42.480
with a weak body

13:42.550 --> 13:43.870
and obeying all your orders?

13:44.860 --> 13:46.070
I won't let anyone else

13:46.090 --> 13:47.060
control my fate.

13:47.740 --> 13:48.570
I'm actually interested

13:48.600 --> 13:49.550
in fighting against you to the end.

13:49.790 --> 13:50.840
I will never let you have your way!

13:59.440 --> 14:00.390
Interesting.

14:02.630 --> 14:03.360
Su Yu,

14:04.270 --> 14:05.240
after seeing you today,

14:05.240 --> 14:06.440
I really pity you.

14:07.910 --> 14:10.270
I'll let you have the universe!

14:34.900 --> 14:35.930
When the devil came,

14:35.960 --> 14:37.030
it's not like I couldn't dodge.

14:37.440 --> 14:38.270
But you

14:38.300 --> 14:39.420
just used your hand to stop it.

14:41.240 --> 14:42.030
Ms. Wen.

14:42.510 --> 14:43.200
Elder Yan.

14:44.320 --> 14:44.960
Ranran,

14:45.240 --> 14:45.910
let's sit and talk.

14:49.750 --> 14:50.960
I saw Hollow Sect's signal talisman

14:50.960 --> 14:51.870
nearby,

14:52.120 --> 14:52.870
so I rushed here.

14:53.200 --> 14:54.030
On my way here,

14:54.240 --> 14:55.630
I killed a devilized demon.

14:56.510 --> 14:57.670
Just now, we eliminated

14:57.670 --> 14:59.360
a group of devilized demons nearby.

14:59.630 --> 15:00.960
You must have encountered one

15:00.960 --> 15:01.870
that escaped.

15:01.960 --> 15:02.750
Currently,

15:02.750 --> 15:04.480
the devilization of demons is getting worse.

15:04.870 --> 15:05.840
We must solve the problem.

15:06.790 --> 15:08.080
Based on the current information

15:08.080 --> 15:08.960
gathered from various sources,

15:09.120 --> 15:10.240
only the Gold Refining Fire

15:10.630 --> 15:12.390
can thoroughly purify the energy in the universe

15:12.750 --> 15:13.630
and handle the devilization.

15:13.790 --> 15:14.870
The Gold Refining Fire?

15:16.760 --> 15:18.210
It's said that the Spirit Spring,

15:18.230 --> 15:19.420
transformed from Mortal-Demon Lord's spiritual power,

15:19.630 --> 15:20.440
was sealed in the netherworld,

15:21.210 --> 15:22.720
but his remains remained indestructible.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.240
The immortals then

15:24.240 --> 15:25.600
created the Gold Refining Fire

15:26.030 --> 15:27.510
to burn Mortal-Demon Lord's remains to ashes.

15:27.910 --> 15:28.790
Is that it?

15:30.150 --> 15:31.790
Mortal-Demon Lord's remains were sealed

15:31.790 --> 15:32.840
at the former site of Celestial Sect:

15:32.910 --> 15:33.870
Mount Scarlet Flame.

15:34.480 --> 15:35.320
Mount Scarlet Flame

15:35.510 --> 15:37.000
is currently occupied by Wei Jiu.

15:37.810 --> 15:38.890
Tu Jiuyuan, his subordinate,

15:38.910 --> 15:40.240
is willing to cooperate with us

15:40.270 --> 15:41.480
to obtain the Gold Refining Fire together.

15:41.870 --> 15:42.390
Therefore,

15:42.960 --> 15:43.790
I have sent a message

15:43.810 --> 15:44.980
to all the Heavenly Sects,

15:45.080 --> 15:46.240
inviting them to go to Mount Scarlet Flame together

15:47.030 --> 15:47.870
to break the formation and obtain the fire.

15:48.390 --> 15:49.790
But what Tu Jiuyuan wants

15:50.200 --> 15:51.630
might not be what Wei Jiu wants.

15:51.960 --> 15:53.720
Of course we should be wary in case it's a trap.

15:54.120 --> 15:54.910
If we can obtain it peacefully, that's fine.

15:55.240 --> 15:56.000
If not,

15:56.510 --> 15:57.720
we'll take it by force.

16:01.910 --> 16:02.630
Ranran,

16:03.600 --> 16:04.320
Yishui has always been unwilling

16:04.320 --> 16:05.840
to associate with the other Heavenly Sects.

16:06.990 --> 16:08.320
I wonder if Wester Sect

16:09.200 --> 16:10.360
is willing to go with us this time.

16:10.960 --> 16:12.630
No matter what Master's decision is,

16:13.000 --> 16:13.870
I, Xue Ranran,

16:14.150 --> 16:15.840
will definitely do what I can

16:16.070 --> 16:17.000
to help solve the devilization problem.

16:19.630 --> 16:21.200
Who are you sending a message to?

16:24.320 --> 16:25.240
Who is it for?

16:25.790 --> 16:26.550
What's the message about?

16:27.200 --> 16:28.550
I told Master

16:29.200 --> 16:31.200
you plan to secretly go to Mount Scarlet Flame

16:31.730 --> 16:33.140
to get the Gold Refining Fire.

16:33.200 --> 16:33.670
You...

16:34.850 --> 16:35.880
All you care about now

16:35.910 --> 16:37.150
is your master.

16:37.510 --> 16:38.840
Your heart is with her too, right?

16:40.150 --> 16:41.550
Where does that leave me?

16:43.630 --> 16:44.440
Wu,

16:44.840 --> 16:45.840
I'm doing this for you.

16:46.700 --> 16:47.900
Right now, all the Heavenly Sects

16:47.960 --> 16:49.440
are heading to Mount Scarlet Flame.

16:50.120 --> 16:51.240
Master will definitely go too

16:51.240 --> 16:52.320
to obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

16:53.270 --> 16:54.480
You're no match for them.

16:55.720 --> 16:57.000
I revealed your plan

16:58.030 --> 16:59.960
because I want you to give up.

17:00.750 --> 17:01.960
Why do you have to risk your life

17:02.200 --> 17:03.600
for Dun Tian?

17:04.430 --> 17:05.540
You don't understand at all.

17:06.599 --> 17:07.359
I understand.

17:09.000 --> 17:10.270
When you were drunk that day, you said

17:11.480 --> 17:12.310
Dun Tian would take you

17:12.310 --> 17:13.589
to another world —

17:14.480 --> 17:15.920
a world without Qingge.

17:17.240 --> 17:18.310
I just want to know

17:18.750 --> 17:19.829
if you can give me what I want

17:20.550 --> 17:22.310
after all that I've done.

17:24.750 --> 17:25.440
Wu,

17:26.270 --> 17:27.829
I remember you once said

17:28.590 --> 17:29.480
if Mu Qingge didn't exist

17:29.480 --> 17:30.510
in this world,

17:31.030 --> 17:32.790
you might live more at ease.

17:33.640 --> 17:34.270
What if there really is

17:34.270 --> 17:35.550
a world like that?

17:35.960 --> 17:37.000
From beginning to end,

17:37.110 --> 17:38.510
you would be the only daughter in your family.

17:38.750 --> 17:40.510
You wouldn't need to compete with others.

17:41.170 --> 17:42.560
Would you be happy?

17:45.160 --> 17:46.270
You still don't understand.

17:46.750 --> 17:48.350
Uncle Ye Xin just told me

17:48.350 --> 17:49.590
that there is such a world.

17:51.160 --> 17:52.240
He never said

17:52.240 --> 17:53.160
he would take me there.

17:54.310 --> 17:55.750
Because in his eyes,

17:57.000 --> 17:58.480
I'm not important at all.

18:00.790 --> 18:02.240
So I have to get

18:02.640 --> 18:03.830
more useful bargaining chips.

18:04.680 --> 18:06.200
He wants the Gold Refining Fire,

18:06.920 --> 18:07.720
then I have to get

18:07.750 --> 18:08.880
the Gold Refining Fire.

18:11.000 --> 18:11.680
That way,

18:13.550 --> 18:14.750
I can bargain with Uncle Ye Xin

18:14.750 --> 18:15.920
about the next step.

18:19.060 --> 18:20.190
No one can stop me

18:22.740 --> 18:23.990
from getting what I want.

18:29.760 --> 18:30.800
This way, this way.

18:32.910 --> 18:34.540
It was really good tonight.

18:35.550 --> 18:36.070
Goodbye.

18:37.450 --> 18:38.360
I'll come again.

18:38.500 --> 18:39.020
Okay.

18:40.760 --> 18:43.470
When Prince Ping reigns over the universe,

18:43.530 --> 18:46.000
you'll get what you deserve.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.200
Get her out

18:48.680 --> 18:49.570
and take good care of her.

18:50.530 --> 18:51.010
Yes.

19:17.530 --> 19:18.120
Master.

19:18.840 --> 19:19.730
Since everything was fine,

19:20.080 --> 19:21.290
why were you sleeping here?

19:21.770 --> 19:23.330
I heard you went to the capital.

19:23.530 --> 19:24.360
I was worried.

19:24.570 --> 19:25.440
Worried about Su Yu?

19:27.120 --> 19:28.010
Were you worried I would

19:28.010 --> 19:29.050
kill him and his whole family

19:29.050 --> 19:30.050
and just take his place?

19:30.360 --> 19:30.880
Is he...

19:31.330 --> 19:32.050
alright?

19:33.640 --> 19:34.640
You really are worried about him.

19:36.400 --> 19:38.050
I heard you used to live in the imperial palace

19:38.570 --> 19:39.680
and you were around him every day.

19:40.640 --> 19:41.530
And he even wanted to marry you.

19:45.460 --> 19:46.740
How did you manage to flirt with him

19:46.770 --> 19:47.880
while also seducing me?

19:53.880 --> 19:55.050
Who is he to be compared to me?

19:55.390 --> 19:56.260
I'm going to kill him right now!

19:56.380 --> 19:57.210
From beginning to end,

19:57.400 --> 19:58.490
you've always been the one I like.

19:58.810 --> 20:00.010
I was worried about you.

20:04.200 --> 20:04.920
Worried about what?

20:06.090 --> 20:06.810
Do you think I would let

20:06.840 --> 20:08.250
Dun Tian, that old man, manipulate me?

20:10.530 --> 20:12.200
I don't know what Dun Tian's plan is,

20:12.670 --> 20:13.540
but since he desperately wants me

20:13.570 --> 20:14.400
to send an army and create chaos,

20:14.970 --> 20:15.880
I'll do just the opposite of what he wants.

20:17.700 --> 20:18.370
Master,

20:18.600 --> 20:19.440
you're not going to send an army?

20:19.860 --> 20:20.990
I've just decided to postpone the plan

20:21.010 --> 20:21.880
based on the current situation.

20:22.640 --> 20:23.230
Don't think

20:23.250 --> 20:24.400
you've influenced me in any way.

20:27.840 --> 20:29.200
Master, you're wise and strong,

20:29.250 --> 20:30.050
resourceful and reasonable,

20:30.290 --> 20:31.090
and resolute.

20:39.490 --> 20:40.010
By the way,

20:40.490 --> 20:42.090
to solve the devilization problem,

20:42.200 --> 20:44.160
the other Heavenly Sects plan to go to Celestial Sect's Mount Scarlet Flame

20:44.200 --> 20:45.200
to obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.490
Master, would you like to go together?

20:47.770 --> 20:49.090
Since the devilization problem is somehow

20:49.250 --> 20:50.490
related to Dun Tian,

20:51.120 --> 20:51.810
and he prompted the Heavenly Sects

20:51.810 --> 20:53.290
to get the Gold Refining Fire,

20:53.530 --> 20:54.810
he must be up to something.

20:55.330 --> 20:55.920
Mu...

20:56.920 --> 20:57.880
Mu Qingge

20:58.120 --> 20:59.810
is also determined to obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

21:00.820 --> 21:01.540
Maybe Dun Tian

21:01.570 --> 21:03.330
wants to use the Heavenly Sects

21:03.360 --> 21:04.290
to break the formation and obtain the fire,

21:04.620 --> 21:05.710
and then take it from them.

21:06.160 --> 21:07.050
Something doesn't feel right.

21:08.010 --> 21:09.160
But with devils running rampant,

21:09.290 --> 21:10.360
the world is in chaos.

21:11.010 --> 21:12.400
No matter what Dun Tian is up to,

21:12.770 --> 21:14.290
we can only be cautious

21:14.840 --> 21:16.010
and obtain the Gold Refining Fire

21:16.290 --> 21:17.440
to eliminate devils and restore order.

21:18.250 --> 21:20.250
Indeed, we can't let Dun Tian have his way.

21:20.770 --> 21:22.290
I'll get the Gold Refining Fire

21:22.530 --> 21:23.440
and see what he'll do.

21:23.980 --> 21:24.650
Master,

21:24.970 --> 21:25.880
you're willing to go together?

21:26.970 --> 21:28.600
I heard that a demonic cultivator named Wei Jiu

21:28.930 --> 21:30.020
has been boasting a name on par with mine

21:30.050 --> 21:31.440
to deceive people across the universe

21:31.440 --> 21:32.400
over the past ten-odd years.

21:32.680 --> 21:34.040
I'd like to meet him.

21:36.050 --> 21:36.570
Right,

21:37.040 --> 21:38.490
Wang Suizhi, who sent me the message,

21:38.570 --> 21:39.770
also mentioned something else.

21:40.490 --> 21:41.440
He said

21:41.640 --> 21:42.360
Dun Tian

21:42.380 --> 21:43.790
mentioned another world.

21:45.050 --> 21:45.680
The Spirit Spring.

21:46.090 --> 21:47.090
The Gold Refining Fire.

21:47.600 --> 21:48.330
Make everything start anew.

21:48.840 --> 21:49.970
Another world.

21:51.120 --> 21:52.880
What on earth is their connection?

21:57.610 --> 21:58.440
Sovereign,

21:58.570 --> 21:59.970
you only asked us to keep an eye on Elder Tu

22:00.050 --> 22:01.530
to prevent her from recklessly entering the formation

22:01.640 --> 22:02.730
or suddenly leaving the sect.

22:03.050 --> 22:04.600
But I...

22:04.810 --> 22:05.970
saw something else.

22:06.640 --> 22:08.010
I'm not sure if I should report it to you.

22:08.330 --> 22:09.010
What is it exactly?

22:09.200 --> 22:09.840
What happened to her?

22:12.440 --> 22:13.330
Just tell me!

22:13.890 --> 22:14.850
Elder Tu sent a secret message

22:14.880 --> 22:15.730
to the Heavenly Sects,

22:15.820 --> 22:16.540
inviting them to come

22:16.570 --> 22:17.770
to Celestial Sect's Mount Scarlet Flame

22:17.970 --> 22:18.880
to obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

22:19.530 --> 22:20.210
How dare she...

22:23.040 --> 22:24.320
Does she really want to leave that badly?

22:37.270 --> 22:39.310
Anyway, with the power of Celestial Sect alone,

22:39.840 --> 22:40.640
it would be difficult

22:40.640 --> 22:42.120
to break the Five Deadly Formations in a short time.

22:42.660 --> 22:43.700
Since those Heavenly Sects' men

22:43.730 --> 22:44.840
have been lured here,

22:45.570 --> 22:46.770
why don't I set up a formation

22:46.770 --> 22:47.440
in the back mountain

22:47.460 --> 22:48.290
to welcome them?

22:49.320 --> 22:50.600
After they break the formations,

22:51.200 --> 22:52.890
I'll take advantage of that

22:53.010 --> 22:54.330
to get the Gold Refining Fire.

22:55.120 --> 22:55.970
Sovereign, that's a brilliant strategy.

22:57.050 --> 22:58.160
Then Elder Tu...

22:58.600 --> 22:59.440
Don't let her know.

23:00.070 --> 23:00.490
I

23:00.490 --> 23:01.330
intend to catch her

23:01.330 --> 23:02.250
off guard.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.440
As long as the Gold Refining Fire

23:04.440 --> 23:05.880
isn't given to me by her personally,

23:06.250 --> 23:07.970
it can't be considered that she has fulfilled her promise.

23:08.400 --> 23:10.240
[Mount Wester]

23:12.520 --> 23:13.650
This time,

23:13.680 --> 23:14.850
I can finally ride

23:14.870 --> 23:15.940
the luxurious carriage

23:15.970 --> 23:17.120
I didn't get to ride last time.

23:18.320 --> 23:19.090
The other disciples

23:19.120 --> 23:20.160
are on their way there by riding a sword.

23:20.770 --> 23:22.050
You guys go there by riding a sword too.

23:24.440 --> 23:24.840
You,

23:24.920 --> 23:25.530
get in the carriage.

23:28.200 --> 23:29.730
-Yes, Master.
-Yes, Master.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.010
The carriage...

23:34.190 --> 23:35.340
is for me?

23:37.600 --> 23:38.770
Your spiritual power is so weak,

23:38.920 --> 23:39.730
and you can't ride a sword.

23:40.170 --> 23:41.370
Do you expect me to carry you there?

23:42.810 --> 23:43.970
I'll just ride the carriage then.

23:55.050 --> 23:55.770
Mu Qingge?

23:56.640 --> 23:57.680
What are you doing here?

23:58.540 --> 23:59.740
Back then, you slandered Su Yishui by saying

23:59.770 --> 24:00.530
he was going to turn into a devil.

24:00.710 --> 24:02.190
It almost delayed the sealing of the Spirit Spring.

24:02.570 --> 24:03.330
This time,

24:03.680 --> 24:04.770
what are you up to?

24:05.160 --> 24:06.730
Immortal Master Wen, your words are too harsh.

24:07.250 --> 24:08.690
I was misinformed before,

24:09.160 --> 24:10.230
and I'm truly sorry for that.

24:10.910 --> 24:12.080
So I came here

24:12.300 --> 24:13.500
to help obtain

24:13.530 --> 24:14.400
the Gold Refining Fire

24:14.920 --> 24:16.120
to make amends for that.

24:16.360 --> 24:17.120
Since you're willing

24:17.120 --> 24:18.490
to join us in obtaining the Gold Refining Fire

24:18.840 --> 24:20.490
to suppress devils and benefit the people,

24:21.050 --> 24:22.160
we naturally welcome you.

24:23.330 --> 24:24.680
You came for the Gold Refining Fire.

24:25.050 --> 24:27.010
Is it really for solving the devilization problem?

24:29.400 --> 24:30.120
Mu Qingge!

24:38.250 --> 24:38.920
You disloyal disciple!

24:39.170 --> 24:40.400
Do you want to betray

24:40.710 --> 24:41.570
your master again

24:41.570 --> 24:42.770
in front of everyone?

24:48.640 --> 24:49.250
How could this happen?

24:49.730 --> 24:51.050
No matter how great the protective formation is,

24:51.200 --> 24:52.250
it was given to you.

24:52.810 --> 24:53.880
Yet you won't spend time

24:53.880 --> 24:54.790
fully mastering it.

24:55.120 --> 24:56.530
It's truly a waste on you.

24:59.730 --> 25:01.090
The Soul-Devouring Lock still exists.

25:01.600 --> 25:02.570
If you kill me,

25:03.160 --> 25:04.600
Xue Ranran will die too.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.090
Don't worry.

25:07.770 --> 25:08.970
I'm not going to kill you now.

25:09.920 --> 25:11.530
Don't you enjoy torturing others?

25:12.090 --> 25:13.330
Once the Soul-Devouring Lock is removed,

25:13.680 --> 25:14.320
I'll make you

25:14.320 --> 25:15.490
endure far greater pain.

25:18.120 --> 25:19.930
Today, I have to get the Gold Refining Fire.

25:20.770 --> 25:21.840
Just you wait.

25:23.680 --> 25:25.120
Celestial Sect invited us here,

25:25.200 --> 25:26.120
yet they're not opening the gate.

25:26.490 --> 25:27.600
Could it be that they've changed their minds?

25:35.330 --> 25:36.810
Everyone, you've arrived as promised.

25:37.490 --> 25:38.640
Celestial Sect

25:38.660 --> 25:40.270
will also open the back mountain as promised

25:40.610 --> 25:42.370
for you to obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

25:43.250 --> 25:44.050
Please come with me.

25:44.160 --> 25:44.680
Wait.

25:46.150 --> 25:47.950
You allow us to get

25:47.980 --> 25:49.460
the Gold Refining Fire so easily.

25:50.440 --> 25:52.640
Who knows if this is a trap?

25:54.600 --> 25:55.490
Rest assured, everyone.

25:55.770 --> 25:57.420
I harbor no ill intentions.

25:57.930 --> 25:58.890
It's just that in the back mountain,

25:58.920 --> 26:00.330
there are the Five Deadly Formations

26:00.330 --> 26:01.290
guarding the Gold Refining Fire.

26:01.790 --> 26:02.870
Even I

26:03.250 --> 26:04.290
have no way to break them.

26:04.770 --> 26:06.600
We can only work together.

26:07.290 --> 26:07.970
I

26:08.350 --> 26:09.790
am willing to cooperate with you.

26:15.030 --> 26:15.980
I'm afraid that once we

26:16.010 --> 26:17.250
break the formations,

26:17.360 --> 26:18.350
Celestial Sect

26:18.490 --> 26:19.810
will go back on your word.

26:21.290 --> 26:22.730
If you're worried,

26:23.050 --> 26:25.770
I, Tu Jiuyuan, can make a soul oath.

26:26.230 --> 26:27.430
If Celestial Sect,

26:27.570 --> 26:29.330
in the matter of obtaining the Gold Refining Fire,

26:29.560 --> 26:31.450
does anything to harm the Heavenly Sects

26:31.600 --> 26:33.330
or uses the Heavenly Sects for personal gain,

26:33.970 --> 26:35.120
I, Tu Jiuyuan,

26:35.440 --> 26:36.600
will suffer divine punishment.

26:38.560 --> 26:39.870
Please lead the way, Elder Tu.

26:40.600 --> 26:41.330
Please, everyone.

26:44.970 --> 26:45.600
Report!

26:47.440 --> 26:48.200
My Lord,

26:48.470 --> 26:50.080
in order to gain the trust of the Heavenly Sects,

26:50.250 --> 26:52.090
Elder Tu made a soul oath in front of them.

26:52.680 --> 26:53.250
What?

26:54.010 --> 26:55.160
I had everything prepared,

26:55.460 --> 26:56.640
yet she acted on her own

26:56.840 --> 26:57.600
and made a soul oath!

26:59.810 --> 27:00.290
Everyone,

27:00.840 --> 27:02.570
the Five Deadly Formations are behind the barrier.

27:03.250 --> 27:04.820
Celestial Sect's power is limited.

27:05.490 --> 27:07.100
We still can't break the barrier.

27:08.490 --> 27:08.970
Elder Tu,

27:09.250 --> 27:09.970
His Lordship wants to see you.

27:10.120 --> 27:11.320
He wants you to go immediately.

27:11.970 --> 27:12.530
Got it.

27:20.050 --> 27:20.640
Tu Jiuyuan,

27:21.020 --> 27:21.850
why did you make that soul oath

27:21.880 --> 27:22.840
in front of the Heavenly Sects?

27:23.210 --> 27:24.160
If I hadn't done that,

27:24.490 --> 27:25.600
the Heavenly Sects wouldn't have let

27:25.600 --> 27:26.490
their guard down to cooperate with us.

27:27.090 --> 27:27.920
My Lord, don't worry.

27:28.050 --> 27:29.290
The soul oath was made by me alone.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.730
It won't affect you.

27:31.990 --> 27:33.670
If you want to take it from them,

27:33.850 --> 27:35.130
feel free to do it.

27:35.840 --> 27:37.010
I won't have any complaints.

27:37.050 --> 27:37.360
You...

27:40.290 --> 27:40.880
Fine.

27:41.120 --> 27:42.440
Since you acted on your own,

27:42.800 --> 27:43.610
don't blame me

27:43.640 --> 27:44.680
for disregarding your life!

27:47.490 --> 27:48.990
You brought this upon yourself.

27:49.840 --> 27:51.080
My Lord, may you

27:51.770 --> 27:52.880
get what you want

27:53.490 --> 27:54.990
and dominate the universe early.

28:01.400 --> 28:01.970
My Lord,

28:02.770 --> 28:04.440
should we still proceed with our plan?

28:05.490 --> 28:06.360
Proceed with what?

28:07.400 --> 28:08.400
Withdraw all our people!

28:09.600 --> 28:10.120
Withdraw everyone?

28:11.090 --> 28:12.400
The Heavenly Sects brought many people here.

28:12.730 --> 28:13.570
It might be difficult to deal with them.

28:13.970 --> 28:14.680
Do you want me

28:14.920 --> 28:16.570
to watch her die?

28:17.200 --> 28:18.600
My Lord, you're concerned about Elder Tu.

28:18.810 --> 28:19.810
Why didn't you just tell her?

28:19.840 --> 28:20.290
Shut up!

28:22.400 --> 28:23.330
Why should I

28:24.290 --> 28:25.880
humbly explain my thoughts

28:25.900 --> 28:27.150
to a woman?

28:28.490 --> 28:28.970
Anyway,

28:29.580 --> 28:30.370
try our best to obtain

28:30.400 --> 28:31.360
the Gold Refining Fire

28:31.760 --> 28:32.760
without triggering the soul oath.

28:42.360 --> 28:43.570
The malicious energy is so strong.

28:44.010 --> 28:46.120
I thought the formations were set up by the Immortal Realm.

28:47.050 --> 28:48.840
I heard the Five Deadly Formations

28:48.840 --> 28:49.840
were formed later.

28:50.530 --> 28:52.120
It was originally called the Five Immortal Formations.

28:52.680 --> 28:53.530
The Five Immortal Formations?

28:54.360 --> 28:54.970
That's right.

28:55.360 --> 28:56.010
It's said that

28:56.290 --> 28:57.570
after Mortal-Demon Lord died,

28:57.880 --> 28:59.640
his remains still emitted strong demonic energy.

29:00.490 --> 29:02.490
The Immortal Realm created the Gold Refining Fire

29:02.890 --> 29:04.610
here on Mount Scarlet Flame

29:04.800 --> 29:06.040
to incinerate the remains.

29:06.810 --> 29:08.120
However, even so,

29:08.290 --> 29:10.680
it would still take a few hundred years

29:10.890 --> 29:12.460
to completely burn Mortal-Demon Lord's remains

29:12.490 --> 29:14.430
to ashes.

29:15.690 --> 29:16.650
To prevent people

29:16.680 --> 29:18.010
from coveting the Gold Refining Fire,

29:18.450 --> 29:21.240
the Immortal Realm ordered five guardians of the Heavenly Sects

29:21.290 --> 29:23.970
to set up the Five Immortal Formations here

29:24.250 --> 29:26.200
to protect the Gold Refining Fire.

29:26.950 --> 29:28.380
It's been quite a few hundred years.

29:29.160 --> 29:30.050
The remains of Mortal-Demon Lord

29:30.050 --> 29:31.010
must have been burnt to ashes long ago.

29:31.530 --> 29:32.650
Then how did the Five Immortal Formations

29:33.010 --> 29:34.440
turn into the Five Deadly Formations?

29:34.890 --> 29:37.000
Perhaps it's because many devils died here,

29:37.570 --> 29:38.440
and they had strong resentment.

29:39.100 --> 29:39.970
Over time,

29:40.340 --> 29:41.650
even the Five Immortal Formations had been contaminated

29:41.680 --> 29:42.200
by the malicious energy

29:42.490 --> 29:43.920
and turned into the Five Deadly Formations.

29:44.640 --> 29:45.360
If

29:45.380 --> 29:47.100
Wei Jiu hadn't reopened this mountain gate,

29:47.380 --> 29:49.790
we would never have seen the formations.

29:50.200 --> 29:50.920
That's right!

29:51.360 --> 29:52.570
If our sovereign

29:52.600 --> 29:54.050
hadn't reopened Celestial Sect,

29:54.290 --> 29:55.810
you probably wouldn't even have been able

29:56.050 --> 29:57.250
to climb up this mountain.

29:59.840 --> 30:01.120
Masters of the Heavenly Sects,

30:01.880 --> 30:03.400
you came to the territory of Celestial Sect

30:03.930 --> 30:05.450
and have been observing for quite a while.

30:05.920 --> 30:07.400
I wonder what insights you've gained.

30:10.250 --> 30:12.160
Sovereign Wei, you've been running around for 20 years.

30:12.970 --> 30:14.490
Now that the mountain gate is finally open,

30:14.810 --> 30:15.730
I'm sure you must have studied

30:15.880 --> 30:16.770
the formations thoroughly.

30:17.570 --> 30:18.810
Why don't you

30:19.090 --> 30:20.290
enlighten us?

30:20.530 --> 30:20.970
You...

30:25.400 --> 30:26.330
If Ranran

30:26.530 --> 30:28.290
is willing to stay with me at Mount Scarlet Flame for a few days,

30:29.730 --> 30:30.490
I'll tell you

30:30.850 --> 30:32.170
the secrets of the formations.

30:39.440 --> 30:41.200
This devil is just bluffing.

30:41.530 --> 30:43.360
If he knows the secrets of the formations,

30:43.730 --> 30:45.530
he wouldn't have invited us here to break the formations.

30:46.120 --> 30:46.810
Am I right,

30:47.010 --> 30:47.640
Wei Jiu?

30:50.050 --> 30:51.120
You're right.

30:51.460 --> 30:53.420
The Five Deadly Formations may seem ordinary,

30:53.730 --> 30:54.640
but they're extremely dangerous.

30:55.200 --> 30:56.130
So far, no one has been able

30:56.160 --> 30:57.490
to unravel its mysteries.

30:58.160 --> 30:59.200
But it's said

30:59.200 --> 31:00.200
these five formations

31:00.840 --> 31:02.200
are all interconnected.

31:02.840 --> 31:04.250
If you break one of them,

31:04.640 --> 31:06.400
the other four will automatically become ineffective.

31:06.730 --> 31:08.160
How difficult are these five formations?

31:08.880 --> 31:10.250
It's said they are equally challenging.

31:10.840 --> 31:11.840
Everyone, you will have to

31:11.890 --> 31:13.130
rely on your own capabilities.

31:14.100 --> 31:14.730
Everyone,

31:15.120 --> 31:17.010
I'm willing to lead Luoshan Sect's disciples

31:17.520 --> 31:18.870
to be the scouts for you.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.120
The sovereign of Luoshan Sect

31:25.360 --> 31:26.250
is quite bold.

31:26.730 --> 31:28.450
He has a top-grade formation-breaking weapon.

31:28.570 --> 31:29.400
Of course he's not afraid.

31:34.160 --> 31:34.920
Blood?

31:35.330 --> 31:36.290
There's no sign of life.

31:37.530 --> 31:38.360
They're dead?

31:38.810 --> 31:40.010
The Five Deadly Formations are very mysterious.

31:40.570 --> 31:41.120
Everyone,

31:41.200 --> 31:42.290
don't let your guard down.

31:42.530 --> 31:44.330
Only by breaking the Five Deadly Formations

31:45.330 --> 31:46.680
can we obtain the Gold Refining Fire

31:46.730 --> 31:47.810
to subdue devils.

31:49.810 --> 31:50.810
We, Hollow Sect,

31:51.530 --> 31:52.530
can't back down.

31:53.710 --> 31:54.670
All disciples,

31:55.160 --> 31:55.970
follow me into the formations!

31:59.730 --> 32:00.920
Eternal Sect's disciples, follow me into the formations!

32:01.090 --> 32:01.640
-Yes!
-Yes!

32:03.180 --> 32:04.510
All disciples, follow me to break the formations.

32:05.490 --> 32:06.400
Scud Sect's disciples,

32:06.540 --> 32:07.260
come with me!

32:08.840 --> 32:09.970
Today, no matter what,

32:09.970 --> 32:11.290
I must obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

32:11.850 --> 32:13.330
But that damn Su Yishui has broken

32:13.360 --> 32:14.400
my protective formation.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.120
I need

32:16.120 --> 32:17.400
to figure out a safer way.

32:18.120 --> 32:18.600
Master.

32:19.290 --> 32:20.050
We joined Wester Sect not long ago,

32:20.440 --> 32:21.160
and our power is limited.

32:21.640 --> 32:22.490
Yes, Master.

32:22.920 --> 32:24.260
I... I'm worried we can't be

32:24.290 --> 32:25.250
very helpful and might even

32:25.440 --> 32:26.120
become your burden.

32:27.010 --> 32:27.510
Fine.

32:28.090 --> 32:28.970
Leave the spiritual power

32:28.970 --> 32:29.570
you gained in Wester Sect

32:29.570 --> 32:30.050
and get lost.

32:52.010 --> 32:52.840
Hold on to me tightly!

32:58.810 --> 32:59.770
All of you, hold on tight!

33:04.230 --> 33:05.230
Hold tight!

33:07.810 --> 33:08.290
Xi'er!

33:08.440 --> 33:09.050
Xi'er!

33:09.400 --> 33:09.970
Xi'er!

33:19.560 --> 33:23.040
[Inside the Five Deadly Formations]

33:34.360 --> 33:35.690
Master, I disobeyed your order.

33:37.010 --> 33:38.090
Please punish me.

33:42.770 --> 33:44.200
You broke the rule to save your fellow disciples.

33:44.680 --> 33:45.570
It's understandable.

33:46.090 --> 33:47.130
Let it go from now on.

33:59.770 --> 34:00.330
My disciples

34:00.330 --> 34:01.630
all died in the vortex.

34:02.010 --> 34:03.250
I want to act together with you.

34:03.920 --> 34:05.370
If you don't want to die in a miserable way,

34:05.810 --> 34:07.090
stop showing up in front of me!

34:07.850 --> 34:09.530
If I die in the formation,

34:10.120 --> 34:11.010
she will die too!

34:12.850 --> 34:13.800
Think about it carefully.

34:18.760 --> 34:19.800
The formation is dangerous.

34:19.969 --> 34:21.120
Everyone, we must be cautious.

34:21.719 --> 34:22.760
The priority is to find the formation's eye.

34:31.389 --> 34:32.350
Once the formations are broken,

34:32.800 --> 34:34.469
I must be the first to obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

34:41.239 --> 34:41.929
Master,

34:42.489 --> 34:44.760
the runes on the ground are very mysterious.

34:45.120 --> 34:46.010
Do you recognize them?

34:47.090 --> 34:48.449
I once saw a world-destroying formation

34:48.850 --> 34:50.120
in an ancient book.

34:50.530 --> 34:51.600
It's called the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

34:52.409 --> 34:53.159
I think it also used

34:53.159 --> 34:54.050
this kind of rune.

34:54.889 --> 34:56.320
It's said that Mortal-Demon Lord

34:56.409 --> 34:58.120
built a devilish tower that can destroy everything

34:58.450 --> 34:59.410
in Celestial Sect.

34:59.720 --> 35:00.370
Could it be...

35:00.970 --> 35:02.890
building the Three Thousand Realms Tower was

35:03.240 --> 35:04.680
why he got killed by the Heavenly Sects?

35:06.090 --> 35:07.530
That ancient book has been lost,

35:08.280 --> 35:09.490
so it's impossible to verify it now.

35:13.450 --> 35:16.720
♫In March, we make rice milk♫

35:16.940 --> 35:19.610
♫And bring it to our daughter for a taste♫

35:19.760 --> 35:20.410
What's that?

35:20.410 --> 35:23.370
♫In April, we make wine♫

35:23.760 --> 35:26.720
♫A day without it♫

35:26.970 --> 35:30.050
♫Leaves us restless♫

35:48.050 --> 35:48.890
Girls, don't cry.

35:49.370 --> 35:50.850
I'll kill all of them for you!

35:59.320 --> 36:00.280
Who is this demoness?

36:00.410 --> 36:01.640
Her malicious energy is so strong.

36:01.850 --> 36:02.800
I don't think she's one of the five guardians

36:02.800 --> 36:03.530
protecting the formations.

36:03.600 --> 36:04.570
They don't have children.

36:05.160 --> 36:06.050
The song?

36:06.530 --> 36:07.370
Little girls?

36:07.850 --> 36:08.720
She's Rong Yao!

36:09.010 --> 36:10.530
Back in the Memory Cave at the Heavenly Meridian Mountain,

36:10.750 --> 36:12.360
I saw Dun Tian's memories.

36:12.600 --> 36:14.600
The tune his wife, Rong Yao, was humming

36:14.620 --> 36:16.140
is exactly what we just heard!

36:17.280 --> 36:18.760
Rong Yao has taken control of the formations.

36:19.240 --> 36:20.010
What?

36:20.500 --> 36:21.570
Dun Tian's wife

36:21.800 --> 36:23.280
can actually contaminate the formations with malicious energy?

36:24.010 --> 36:25.320
Back then, in order to attain enlightenment, Dun Tian

36:25.570 --> 36:26.600
chose to sacrifice his wife and daughters,

36:26.760 --> 36:27.800
while he himself attained ascension.

36:28.090 --> 36:29.160
Rong Yao and their daughters

36:29.490 --> 36:31.050
were abandoned and sacrificed.

36:31.640 --> 36:32.450
Of course she had

36:32.690 --> 36:33.380
strong resentment.

36:33.410 --> 36:33.970
No wonder.

36:34.640 --> 36:35.600
Although Rong Yao is dead,

36:35.720 --> 36:37.570
her resentment hasn't disappeared over the past few hundred years.

36:37.720 --> 36:39.370
And her malicious energy has gradually contaminated the formations.

36:40.450 --> 36:41.490
It seems Dun Tian is not the only one

36:41.490 --> 36:42.320
who can't let it go.

36:42.640 --> 36:43.640
Rong Yao can't let it go either.

36:44.090 --> 36:45.450
Why did you break in?

36:46.090 --> 36:47.930
All of you deserve to die!

36:48.410 --> 36:49.530
Kill!

36:53.170 --> 36:54.530
Fighting the malicious energy is useless!

36:54.760 --> 36:55.720
Rong Yao is the eye of the formation!

36:55.890 --> 36:56.850
We need to break her true form

36:56.930 --> 36:57.680
to escape!

36:57.930 --> 36:58.490
Master,

36:58.640 --> 36:59.320
let me help you.

37:01.570 --> 37:02.120
Divine Tree!

37:15.320 --> 37:16.090
-Master!
-Master!

37:19.050 --> 37:20.850
You actually managed to hurt me by working together.

37:22.120 --> 37:23.800
I underestimated you.

37:24.370 --> 37:25.320
Your behavior of risking

37:25.320 --> 37:26.570
your lives to protect each other

37:27.120 --> 37:28.850
has really irritated me!

37:29.580 --> 37:31.690
You should know that love

37:31.720 --> 37:32.720
is the most hypocritical

37:32.840 --> 37:33.750
and unreliable in this world!

37:34.600 --> 37:36.530
Today, let me see

37:37.450 --> 37:39.120
how long your hypocritical love

37:39.280 --> 37:40.640
can last!

37:56.270 --> 37:57.630
What did you do to us?

37:57.800 --> 37:59.590
What I cast on you

37:59.980 --> 38:02.170
is Celestial Sect's most powerful torture spell:

38:02.680 --> 38:04.090
the Lone Star Blood Spell!

38:05.360 --> 38:06.610
Those under the spell will endure

38:06.640 --> 38:08.760
searing pain as if consumed by flames.

38:09.410 --> 38:10.570
The stronger one's spiritual power is,

38:10.890 --> 38:12.890
the greater pain that person will suffer.

38:13.050 --> 38:15.240
The blood spell won't end

38:16.090 --> 38:17.890
until either of you dies.

38:20.980 --> 38:21.690
The spell

38:21.720 --> 38:23.370
has connected your spiritual power.

38:23.800 --> 38:24.680
If you transfer

38:24.720 --> 38:25.890
your spiritual power to the other person,

38:26.200 --> 38:27.760
you'll suffer less pain.

38:28.220 --> 38:28.850
How are you feeling?

38:29.270 --> 38:30.140
It's painful, right?

38:32.810 --> 38:33.610
Then transfer

38:33.640 --> 38:34.800
your spiritual power to the other person!

38:35.280 --> 38:37.010
As long as you betray the other,

38:37.640 --> 38:39.640
you can survive!

38:43.560 --> 38:45.370
I'd like to see how much longer you can hold on!

38:45.890 --> 38:46.760
Invoke!

38:52.160 --> 38:52.600
Ranran!

38:52.760 --> 38:53.240
Master!

39:01.010 --> 39:01.970
The Soul-Devouring Lock.

39:09.200 --> 39:10.010
Mu Ranwu and Ranran

39:10.010 --> 39:11.200
are connected by the Soul-Devouring Lock.

39:11.280 --> 39:12.410
They share each other's spiritual power,

39:12.550 --> 39:13.340
so Mu Ranwu is also under the spell

39:13.370 --> 39:14.240
and has been dragged into it!

39:17.280 --> 39:18.570
Master and the others are in danger!

39:20.570 --> 39:22.240
You can't break free from this.

39:22.640 --> 39:23.930
The Lone Star Blood Spell

39:24.200 --> 39:25.890
won't kill all of you.

39:26.600 --> 39:27.570
You have plenty of ways

39:27.600 --> 39:29.320
to ensure your own survival.

39:29.850 --> 39:30.410
What do you think?

39:30.760 --> 39:32.010
Isn't this interesting?

39:33.890 --> 39:34.720
You two

39:35.090 --> 39:36.720
are this monster's target!

39:37.090 --> 39:38.640
Why should I suffer

39:39.200 --> 39:40.090
all this with you

39:40.090 --> 39:41.320
even at this point?

39:46.370 --> 39:47.850
Xue Ranran's spiritual power is weak now.

39:48.320 --> 39:50.050
All the pain and pressure are on my side.

39:50.490 --> 39:51.370
If this continues,

39:51.930 --> 39:53.320
I definitely won't be able to withstand it.

40:05.680 --> 40:06.570
Xue Ranran!

40:07.760 --> 40:09.370
I don't want any of this anymore!

40:09.530 --> 40:11.090
I'm giving it all back to you!

40:11.410 --> 40:12.650
I'm giving all the spiritual power

40:12.680 --> 40:13.760
back to you!

40:13.850 --> 40:15.570
Xue Ranran, I'm giving it all back to you!

40:23.760 --> 40:24.320
Ranran!

40:24.590 --> 40:25.570
The Soul-Devouring Lock is broken!

40:31.090 --> 40:31.850
Oh no.

40:31.890 --> 40:33.050
Since the Soul-Devouring Lock is broken,

40:33.240 --> 40:34.890
all the spiritual power has returned to Ranran's body.

40:35.090 --> 40:36.050
These blood chains...

40:36.720 --> 40:37.530
The stronger Ranran's spiritual power is,

40:37.760 --> 40:39.090
the greater pain she will suffer!

40:44.720 --> 40:45.340
Give it to me!

40:45.370 --> 40:46.090
This is mine!

40:46.120 --> 40:47.280
Don't hit my sister!

40:51.570 --> 40:52.760
This is my Mount Wester.

40:54.230 --> 40:55.000
Shui,

40:55.850 --> 40:56.600
it's you.

41:40.020 --> 41:40.640
Shui?

41:50.300 --> 41:51.980
I've regained all my spiritual power

41:52.320 --> 41:53.200
at the Transcendence Stage.

41:56.570 --> 41:57.800
If you want to live,

41:58.600 --> 41:59.570
just transfer your spiritual power

41:59.600 --> 42:00.800
to the other person!

42:01.850 --> 42:03.240
Today, let me see which of you

42:04.370 --> 42:06.120
can win and which of you

42:10.010 --> 42:11.850
will die first!

42:14.450 --> 42:15.090
Sword of Non-Attachment!

42:15.490 --> 42:16.280
Focus and gather the power.

42:17.760 --> 42:19.200
Harness the energy to command the spirits!

42:19.410 --> 42:20.200
Converge!

42:22.720 --> 42:23.450
What are you doing?

42:23.810 --> 42:24.770
Temporarily boosting

42:24.800 --> 42:25.970
your spiritual power through the living creatures

42:26.280 --> 42:27.640
will make the blood chains rush towards you!

42:28.410 --> 42:29.970
You won't be able to withstand it!

42:30.120 --> 42:30.750
Cut the crap!

42:32.160 --> 42:33.530
I'm not doing this to save you.

42:34.050 --> 42:35.200
I came here to break the formations

42:35.570 --> 42:37.320
to obtain the Gold Refining Fire.

42:37.760 --> 42:39.120
We can't all die here!

42:44.890 --> 42:45.640
But you...

42:48.970 --> 42:49.450
Ranran,

42:50.200 --> 42:50.850
listen to me.

42:51.850 --> 42:53.720
Rong Yao's malicious energy is truly formidable,

42:56.050 --> 42:56.640
but she's used it all

42:57.010 --> 42:58.320
on the blood chain formation.

43:03.200 --> 43:04.450
Rong Yao herself

43:05.010 --> 43:06.970
is now the most vulnerable.

43:08.050 --> 43:08.970
Now,

43:09.930 --> 43:11.600
I'm drawing the blood chains to myself

43:12.120 --> 43:13.530
to reduce your pain.

43:17.490 --> 43:18.640
You take this chance to gather your power

43:19.160 --> 43:20.010
and attack Rong Yao directly!

43:20.560 --> 43:21.530
We only have one chance.

43:22.010 --> 43:23.570
You have to succeed!

43:32.530 --> 43:33.530
-Master!
-Master!
